{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB《東張西望》今集繼續跟進寵物貓咪妮妮接受絕育手術期間不幸被切錯膀胱身亡，事件揭發操刀者竟是毫無專業資格無牌行醫護士。貓主向相關部門求助卻因超過6個月追訴期而面臨調查困境，涉事團隊甚至已另起爐灶開設新診所。絕密錄音與前員工連環爆料讓這間寵物醫院背後更多駭人聽聞操作浮出水面。</p>\n<p>TVB《東張西望》今集繼續跟進寵物貓咪妮妮接受絕育手術期間不幸被切錯膀胱身亡，事件揭發操刀者竟是毫無專業資格無牌行醫護士。事主向相關部門求助卻因超過6個月追訴期而面臨調查困境，涉事團隊甚至已另起爐灶開設新診所。絕密錄音與前員工連環爆料讓這間寵物醫院背後更多駭人聽聞操作浮出水面。</p>\n<h2>前任員工指控護士Polly屢次冒充獸醫做手術</h2>\n<p>早前寵物貓妮妮在診所接受絕育手術期間懷疑遭切除錯誤器官慘死。節目公開相關絕密錄音，證實負責動刀護士Polly根本未考獲註冊獸醫資格。曾於該處任職註冊獸醫出面指證，直指診所內部管理極度混亂，並目擊Polly多次主動要求接手外科手術。這名獸醫透露有助理曾私自將耳藥膏當作眼藥膏配給動物，Polly更涉嫌偽造簽名以購買受管制麻醉藥物氯安酮。</p>\n<h2>拍檔Chloe否認所有指控推卸妮妮死亡責任</h2>\n<p>面對種種嚴厲指控，診所老闆Maggie迅速劃清界線聲稱對事件毫不知情，但曝光錄音卻顯示她一早知悉內情。另一合夥人Chloe接受訪問時同樣全盤否認涉案，堅稱自己並未支薪，被問到有否參與手術時僅以「無」作回應。貓主許先生在2月向獸醫管理局提出正式投訴，其後接獲警方通知指無牌行醫僅有6個月追訴期。大律師陸偉雄解釋無牌行醫與虐畜均屬簡易程序罪行，檢控時效限制導致執法部門搜證出現極大阻力。</p>\n<h2>投資人周先生控訴遭設局詐騙高達120萬</h2>\n<p>隨著風波不斷擴大，更多受害者陸續現身說法。投資人周先生表示當初透過Chloe認識涉案團隊，被遊說入股獸醫診所及樓下貓主題咖啡店，合共注資120萬。他痛斥整個醫療團隊成員全屬親友關係且毫無專業醫療經驗，直指對方只是以開診所為名設局誘騙資金。爆發醫療事故後，這批無牌團隊已被原址負責人趕走，卻隨即帶同原班人馬在同一街道對面開設全新寵物醫院繼續營業。</p>\n<h2>網民怒轟香港缺乏動物醫療監管</h2>\n<p>節目播出後引發社會各界廣泛討論，大批觀眾對無牌行醫者仍能逍遙法外感到極度憤慨。有網民在討論區留言表示「我估計香港唔止呢間，有間打正動保慈善個獸醫都可能係無牌、或其他，一味靠估，前言不對後語」。另有觀眾高度評價節目組跟進報道，大讚「東張係幾好野，TVB而家最有價值既節目」。部分人則對挺身而出前任獸醫頗有微詞，直言「呢個報料獸醫隠惡揚善，都唔係好人，又唔報警」。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179561595399676760_7400196106b06ecd2e56e9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"東張西望 醫療事故 寵物貓咪妮妮接受絕育手術期間不幸被切錯膀胱身亡。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179561595399676760_7400196106b06ecd2e56e9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>寵物貓咪妮妮接受絕育手術期間不幸被切錯膀胱身亡。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179561595643148113_7247848216b06ecd5176c9.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"東張西望 醫療事故 妮妮主人許生對調查未有進展感失望。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179561595643148113_7247848216b06ecd5176c9.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>妮妮主人許生對調查未有進展感失望。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179561596320740309_795462386b06ecdbc2898.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"東張西望 醫療事故 Chloe受訪時否認所有指控。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179561596320740309_795462386b06ecdbc2898.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Chloe受訪時否認所有指控。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179561596869276730_13571281606b06ece11b5bf.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"東張西望 醫療事故 周生認為Polly等團隊均非獸醫，她們是在搭雞棚誘人投資。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179561596869276730_13571281606b06ece11b5bf.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>周生認為Polly等團隊均非獸醫，她們是在搭雞棚誘人投資。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179561597369697499_18473880436b06ece610dc7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"東張西望 醫療事故 寵物診所老闆Polly涉嫌護士扮獸醫動手術致妮妮枉死。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179561597369697499_18473880436b06ece610dc7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>寵物診所老闆Polly涉嫌護士扮獸醫動手術致妮妮枉死。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179561597588535590_134552446b06ece8b3005.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"東張西望 醫療事故 妮妮枉死，懷疑執刀的護士Polly仍然消遙法外。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179561597588535590_134552446b06ece8b3005.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>妮妮枉死，懷疑執刀的護士Polly仍然消遙法外。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179561598288362807_5280704326b06ecef6b5b6.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"東張西望 醫療事故 東張早前報道絕密錄音曝光妮妮絕育手術時被切錯膀胱慘死。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179561598288362807_5280704326b06ecef6b5b6.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>東張早前報道絕密錄音曝光妮妮絕育手術時被切錯膀胱慘死。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179561598779154371_17484594786b06ecf49e1f3.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"東張西望 醫療事故 涉事診所老闆Maggie卸責聲稱自己不知情。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179561598779154371_17484594786b06ecf49e1f3.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>涉事診所老闆Maggie卸責聲稱自己不知情。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179561599340480170_9431360056b06ecf9e9984.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"東張西望 醫療事故 絕密錄音顯示Polly和Maggie都對妮妮枉死事件知情。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179561599340480170_9431360056b06ecf9e9984.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>絕密錄音顯示Polly和Maggie都對妮妮枉死事件知情。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179561599831565822_6021229966b06ecfeaebf0.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"東張西望 醫療事故 陸大狀指簡易程序一般在裁判法院處理。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179561599831565822_6021229966b06ecfeaebf0.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>陸大狀指簡易程序一般在裁判法院處理。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179561600489396797_7836891506b06ed05c03a7.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"東張西望 醫療事故 註冊獸醫指證Polly曾替貓做絕育手術，診所管理混亂。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179561600489396797_7836891506b06ed05c03a7.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>註冊獸醫指證Polly曾替貓做絕育手術，診所管理混亂。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179561601099079564_17645038326b06ed0b8953f.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"東張西望 醫療事故 獸醫指證診所有人冒簽針咭等數宗罪。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179561601099079564_17645038326b06ed0b8953f.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>獸醫指證診所有人冒簽針咭等數宗罪。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179561601384448265_12698122526b06ed0e495b2.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"東張西望 醫療事故 東張主持嘗試聯絡Polly但沒有人接聽。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179561601384448265_12698122526b06ed0e495b2.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>東張主持嘗試聯絡Polly但沒有人接聽。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17956160201011964_4702310266b06ed148e520.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"東張西望 醫療事故 告密者周生指是經Chloe認識Polly才投訴合份開診所。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17956160201011964_4702310266b06ed148e520.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>告密者周生指是經Chloe認識Polly才投訴合份開診所。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T16:25:59.600049+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1766,"images":14,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T14:13:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T16:37:46.665520+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T16:19:18.504382+00:00","content_hash":"d1c12400ada40ecd640029dfab92f1839b1ac7705efcb3eaf9b0e30fe4b402ef","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}